{
  "schema": "viza.fibo_mappings.v1",
  "registry_version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Mapping of VIZA-local taxonomy strings to canonical FIBO IRIs. The Phase 30 asset resolver consults this file to populate CommandTarget.fibo_legal_entity_iri and CommandTarget.fibo_instrument_iri so emitted commands are portable across security masters that speak FIBO. The IRIs use the spec.edmcouncil.org production base; consumers that prefer the development tree can rewrite the prefix. Mappings left as `null` are intentionally absent — the underlying concept has no direct FIBO equivalent and is VIZA-native.",
